# Line-ending discipline — two things here are byte-sensitive:
#
# 1. config JSON: the CONFIG HASH is sha256 of the file bytes (run identity).
#    Git must never normalize line endings in these files on any platform.
# 2. gradlew: executed by sh inside the Linux Docker build — must stay LF.
#
*.json -text
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.md text
*.yml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text
*.properties text
